@startuml
title Activity Diagram: UC-01 Submit Daily Report

|Supervisor (Mobile App)|
start
:Click "Create Daily Report";

|System|
:Retrieve active tasks linked to BOQ;
:Display task list;

|Supervisor (Mobile App)|
:Select completed tasks & enter quantities;
:Log materials and equipment used;
:Input worker count (skilled/unskilled) and hours;
:Select weather condition;
:Capture/upload site photos;

|System|
:Automatically geo-tag photos;

|Supervisor (Mobile App)|
:Log observed site issues/problems;
:Click "Submit Report";

|System|
if (Are all mandatory fields complete?) then (No)
  :Highlight missing fields;
  |Supervisor (Mobile App)|
  :Provide missing information;
  :Click "Submit Report";
else (Yes)
  |System|
  if (Active internet connection?) then (Yes)
    :Validate inputs;
    :Synchronize data with central database;
    :Display success confirmation message;
  else (No)
    :Bypass immediate synchronization;
    :Save report data to local device cache;
    :Display "Saved Offline" message;
    
    note right
      Background process will auto-sync 
      when connection is restored
    end note
  endif
endif

stop
@enduml